simple-engine-2 presentation patch for SDL 3.4.20 (docs/milestone-specs.md M6a).

Adds include/SDL3/SDL_gpu_se.h (SDL_SE_* functions: frame-latency wait,
present statistics, GPU timestamps, native handles, device status) and
its Direct3D 12 and Vulkan backends. Generated with git diff against the
extracted SDL3-3.4.20.tar.gz; applied by cmake/ApplyPatch.cmake.
Rebase notes: docs/deps.md, "SDL presentation patch".

